**Rationale:**
The legacy `corpus_import` domain was removed via **ADR-013** (2025-01-13), superseding the compatibility facade (evidenced by **snap-facade-0207**). The facade is now redundant since the domain is gone. The **allowed action types** explicitly include `DELETE_FACADE` as a recommended consequence. No live commitments are broken because the domain removal was already decided (ADR-013) and CLI/web migrations (issues 088/089) are tracked separately. Thus, the facade can be deleted without conflict.

```json
{
  "actions": [
    {"action_type": "DELETE_FACADE"}
  ]
}
```
